{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31157","headline":"失鹤二首 一 · 薛能","name":"失鹤二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶背雕笼与我违，四方端伫竟忘归。\n谁家白日云间见，何处沧洲雨里飞。\n曾啄稻粱残粒在，旧翘泥潦半踪稀。\n凭人转觉多相误，尽道皤然作令威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}